+void GXSetDrawSync(u16 token);
+u16 GXReadDrawSync(void);
+// re4-port: real hardware's indirect-stage cache mask (BP reg, gates which of GX's 4 indirect
+// stages the SU texture-region logic considers "dirty"); every src/game call site passes 0
